      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BROOKLYN BRUTE (5) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races, hitting the line hard to score two back then came home strongly into third (19.02) in a Grade 5 at this track last time. Has a good record here including seven wins. The form from his last run stacks up well. One of the contenders. DANNY WHIZZ BANG (2) goes very well this trip starting 14 times for five wins and five minors. Missed the frame latest (19.06) when fourth over 318m at Dubbo in a Grade 4/5. Makes strong appeal on best. BLITZ (1) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (18.74) at this track in a Mix 2/3 over 320m. Leading player again. PEARL OF MAUI (8) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
